in k8s namespace inside yaml that is in nano deployment.yaml is useful becoz it tells k8s where the resource should be created
it is useful : 1) seperates environments
               2) better organization
               3) access control
               4) resource control
               5) easier commands
if u donot mention namespace k8s automatically creates it in the default namespace

COMMAND BASED DEPLOYMENT
  quick & simple 
  good for practice & testing
  no YAML file needed
  hard to remember large configurations
  difficult to reuse later

YAML  BASED DEPLOYMENT
  Reusable
  easy to modify
  used in real projects
  supports complex configuration
  can be stored in git
  better for automation & devops

